// Expected results for ALU
// Format: One hex value per line representing result[7:0]
// These correspond to the test vectors in test_vectors.hex
// Test 1: ADD 0x10 + 0x20 = 0x30
// Test 2: ADD 0xff + 0x01 = 0x00 (wrap)
// Test 3: SUB 0x30 - 0x10 = 0x20
// Test 4: SUB 0x10 - 0x20 = 0xf0 (wrap)
// Test 5: AND 0xaa & 0x55 = 0x00
// Test 6: AND 0xff & 0xaa = 0xaa
// Test 7: OR  0xaa | 0x55 = 0xff
// Test 8: OR  0x00 | 0x00 = 0x00
// Test 9: ADD 0x42 + 0x24 = 0x66
// Test 10: AND 0x99 & 0x66 = 0x00
30
00
20
f0
00
aa
